        "original_id": "c0d64677-a12c-504e-839a-150dde9d34ca",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Dujiangyan City, Ezhou, Hubei Province, Huanggang\n- Organizations: Sichuan Leaders F.C.\n- Topics: Population, area, administrative status\n\nFacts:\n- In 2003, Dujiangyan City had an area of 1208 km2 and a population of 600,000.\n- Sichuan Leaders F.C. is an association football club from Dujiangyan City.\n- Ezhou is a prefecture-level city in eastern Hubei Province, China.\n- As of the 2010 census, Ezhou had a population of 1,048,668, including 668,727 residents in the core Echeng District.\n- The built-up Ezhou-Huanggang area had 1,035,496 inhabitants from Echeng District and Huangzhou District, Huanggang.",
